  "id": "production-task",
  "term": "production task",
  "definition": "A production task is a unit of manufacturing work that is placed in a queue for allocating resources, scheduling, and deciding the order of assembly or production activities. In this source, the term is used in the context of ranking such tasks by multiple attributes to optimize the queue.",
